          WordWrap = True
          Caption = '**Just start typing** to edit (that keystroke is the first character) · Enter moves down · Tab advances by cell and wraps · F2 works too · "Qty" spinner · "Amount" slider · "Order No." mask · "Region" dropdown · "Date" calendar · "Rating" star click · "Notes" multiline — all declared **on the columns**, no events wired'
